stream
BT
/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PMFBY Operational Guidelines \(2023\) ? Section I: Scheme Scope & Farmer Coverage) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Section I \(Clause 1-3\)] Scheme Objective, Coverage of Farmers, and Voluntary Participation) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Section I \(Clause 3.1\)] Under the Revamped Operational Guidelines of PMFBY \(effective from Kharif 2020 and consolidated in 2023\), enrolment under Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana is 100% voluntary for all farmers, including both loanee farmers \(availing Seasonal Agricultural Operations loans / KCC\) and non-loanee farmers. Loanee farmers may opt out of PMFBY by submitting a written declaration to their bank branch at least 7 days prior to the enrolment cut-off date for the respective season.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Section I \(Clause 4.2\)] Sum Insured \(SI\) Calculation: The Sum Insured per hectare for both loanee and non-loanee farmers is equal to the Scale of Finance \(SoF\) as decided by the District Level Technical Committee \(DLTC\) or notified area Threshold Yield multiplied by the Minimum Support Price \(MSP\), reaching 100% of the full economic value without any upper reduction capping.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 40 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([PRINTED_PAGE: 1]) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
