/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PMFBY Operational Guidelines \(2023\) ? Section XI: Indemnity, Loss Thresholds & Claim Rules) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Section XI \(Clause 15\)] Indemnity Levels, Threshold Yield, Prevented Sowing, Mid-Season Adversity, and Post-Harvest Coverage) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F2 10 Tf ([TABLE_START | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | SEC=Section XI \(Clause 15.1-15.6, Table 3\) | CAPTION=Table 3: Indemnity Levels, Risk Coverage Triggers, Payout Caps, and Reporting Timelines \(2023 Guidelines\)]) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 726 Tm /F2 10 Tf ([TABLE_HEADERS | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES] Provision / Risk Component | Applicable Crop / Scope | Numerical Value / Limit | Unit / Basis | Mandatory Qualification / Trigger Condition) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 712 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R1] Indemnity Level Tiers | All notified crops \(Kharif and Rabi\) | 70.0%, 80.0%, or 90.0% | % of Threshold Yield \(TY\) | Three levels of indemnity: 70.0% for high-risk areas, 80.0% for moderate-risk areas, and 90.0% for low-risk areas) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 699 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R2] Threshold Yield Calculation Window | All notified crops | 5 years \(best 5 out of preceding 7 years\) | Years of yield data | Threshold Yield equals average yield of best 5 years out of last 7 years multiplied by applicable Indemnity Level) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R3] Prevented / Failed Sowing On-Account Payout | Notified crops in affected Insurance Unit \(IU\) | 25.0% | % of Sum Insured | Maximum payout up to 25.0% of Sum Insured, triggered only when more than 75.0% of sown area in the notified IU is prevented from sowing/germination; insurance cover terminates thereafter) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 673 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R4] Mid-Season Adversity Immediate Relief | Notified crops experiencing severe mid-season calamity | 25.0% | % of likely claims | Advance on-account payment up to 25.0% of likely claims when expected yield during the season falls below 50.0% of normal/threshold yield) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 660 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R5] Post-Harvest Losses Coverage Window | Crops dried in cut-and-spread / small bundled condition in field after harvesting | 14 days \(2 weeks\) | Days from harvesting | Maximum period of 14 days \(2 weeks\) from actual date of harvesting against cyclone, cyclonic rain, unseasonal rain, and hailstorm) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 647 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES | ROW=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES_R6] Localized Calamity & Post-Harvest Intimation Timeline | Individual farm losses \(hailstorm, landslide, inundation, cloudburst, post-harvest\) | 72 hours | Hours from occurrence of peril | Insured farmer must intimate loss within 72 hours of the event via NCIP portal, Crop Insurance App, toll-free helpline, bank, or local agriculture officer) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 634 Tm /F2 10 Tf ([TABLE_END | ID=TBL_OG2023_INDEMNITY_CLAIM_RULES]) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 40 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([PRINTED_PAGE: 4]) Tj
